Z||000003||fierofreek2001||05-12-2001||02:00 AM||||i drive a 4 cyl daily, and let me tell you, i have never broken down or anything.. but saying that its a quick engine is well... not true... those engines are some of the weakest on the road.. if you pull up next to a geo metro, they will prob have no trouble keeping up with you... just my observations from 3 years of driving a 4cyl...dependable, but not too quick<BR>steve||||reg||1
Z||000004||AL||05-12-2001||02:22 AM||||i agree,the iron duke is fun to drive and it does perform modestly for me too,i know it's not my gt but still it's afun car none the less,especilly since i drive a good old indy duke.if i want to go faster i drive my gt,if i want to go even faster i drive my gta but all 3 cars have something to offer,pontiac excitement!<BR><B>AL</B> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/AL_sig.gif"> <BR>84 indy <BR>86gt <BR>89gta<P>------------------<BR> ||||reg||14
