Z||000007||Frank Sombers||05-12-2001||10:41 PM||||As the owner of an '88 Duke powered coupe I can only relay what I tell my 16 year old daughter. Anyone can go fast in a straight line...going fast through the corners is what counts. <BR>Fieros handle (at least the '88s do)and going quick through turns is when you can really make others have red faces. <BR>  <P><BR>||||reg||12
